OL,3,GNEWSABuilding secured for writing and  
OL,4,Apublishing centre                      
OL,6,FA Grade II listed city centre building 
OL,7,Fis set to become a national centre for 
OL,8,Fwriting and publishing.                
OL,10,FThe Old Post Office in St Nicholas     
OL,11,FStreet, Newcastle, was bought for      
OL,12,F#3.65m by charity New Writing North and
OL,13,FNorthumbria University. Work will begin
OL,14,Fin 2027, with the ambition that it will
OL,15,Fbe fully opened to the public in 2029. 
OL,17,FThe centre has received more than      
OL,18,F#10.7m in funding and wants to bring   
OL,19,Ftogether writers, publishers, students,
OL,20,Fand local communities under one roof.  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
