OL,3,GNEWSABuilding secured for writing and  
OL,4,Apublishing centre                      
OL,6,FNew Writing North CEO Claire Malcolm   
OL,7,Fsaid she hoped the project would show  
OL,8,Fyoung people they do not need to leave 
OL,9,Fthe north of England to have a         
OL,10,Fsuccessful literary career.            
